  <h3>Recent policy changes</h3>

  <ul>
    <li>
      August 20, 2026 - Kyrgyzstan and Vietnam were added to both the
      240-hour visa-free transit policy and the Hainan 30-day visa-free entry
      policy. The 240-hour list increased to 57 countries, while the Hainan
      list increased to 61.
    </li>
